OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality wants permanent VAT
OL,4,Acut, 'not gimmick'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitality and tourist businesses in
OL,7,FCornwall are calling for a temporary
OL,8,FVAT reduction scheme to be widened and
OL,9,Fextended.
OL,11,FThe government's #300m Great British
OL,12,FSummer Savings scheme aimed to help
OL,13,Ffamilies with the cost of the summer
OL,14,Fholidays. The temporary 15% VAT
OL,15,Freduction, from 20% to 5%, applied to
OL,16,Ffamily attraction tickets, children's
OL,17,Fmeals and cinema tickets for just under
OL,18,F10 weeks.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
