OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality wants permanent VAT
OL,4,Acut, 'not gimmick'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeith Southwell, managing director of
OL,7,FLappa Valley Railway, said it "hadn't
OL,8,Fmade any difference whatsoever" to his
OL,9,Fbusiness, with many customers
OL,10,F"benefitting but not even realising".
OL,12,FThe government said the scheme was
OL,13,F"increasing footfall for businesses
OL,14,Fover the summer... and boosting local
OL,15,Feconomies".
